#string STR_MODULE_ABSTRACT             #language en-US "UEFI Driver Model example for study purposes"

#string STR_MODULE_DESCRIPTION          #language en-US "This driver demonstrates the standard UEFI Driver Model. It implements EFI_DRIVER_BINDING_PROTOCOL (Supported, Start, Stop) and binds to any handle that supports the DevicePath protocol. The driver installs a marker protocol on the controller to indicate ownership and properly cleans up on Stop."
